      270.71
    ],
    "text": "AN ACT TO TO AMEND THE CONVENTION AGAINST TORTURE AND OTHERCRUEL, INHUMAN OR DEGRADING TREATMENT OR PUNISHMENTACT, NO. 22 OF1994",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      286.97,
      401.9,
      312.11
    ],
    "text": "BE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      328.37,
      401.87,
      367.31
    ],
    "text": "1.This Act may be cited as the Convention AgainstTorture and other Cruel, Inhuman or Degrading Treatmentor Punishment (Amendment) Act, No. of 2021.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      383.57,
      401.93,
      477.71
    ],
    "text": "2.Section 2 of the Convention Against Torture andother Cruel, Inhuman or Degrading Treatment or PunishmentAct, No. 22 of 1994 is hereby amended in subsection (4) ofthat section by the substitution for the words \u201ca fine not lessthan ten thousand rupees and not exceeding fifty thousandrupees.\u201d, of the words \u201ca fine not less than fifty thousandrupees and not exceeding two hundred thousand rupees.\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      492.77,
      401.9,
      516.11
    ],
    "text": "3.In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhalaand Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
